            <ArticleTitle>[Value of myocardial scintigraphy using T1-201 in the diagnosis of ischemic heart disease in patients with block of the left peduncle of the bundle of His].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>84-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Possible use of loading myocardial 201T1 scintigraphy is considered for patients with blocked left peduncle of His' bundle. The procedure is shown to be of considerable value for the prognosis of coronary heart disease in such patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
